            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nai Eliasib ŋolo arae esacaradoti ŋolo apolon nooi togeikis etic kaapei ka ŋisacaradotin ŋuluce, todukokis Epuke ŋolo a Ŋamesekin nabo. Apotu ikes kitaleut Epuke ŋol, kirikakis daŋ akiduk ŋikekya a ŋipukei; apotu ikes kitaleut arwatata ameun a lopuke a Ŋamesekin akitodol naduketait ŋina aoyan ŋina anyaritae ŋina ka Amiat tari naduketait ŋina aoyan ŋina ka Ananel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ameun a nen todukosi ŋituŋa a Yeriko arwatata, kikoba Sukur lokoku a Imuri akiduk a nen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodi toduko ŋidwe ka Asenaa epuke ŋolo a Ŋikolya, kiwuakis ŋakito ŋuna a epuke, ido kiwuakis ŋikekya, ŋigolyet ka ŋasuwa ŋuna ilorere epuke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todukok Merimos lokoku a Uria a ŋolo arae lokoku ka Akos arwatata alokiŋaren neni adukete ŋidwe ka Asenaa, alokiŋaren keŋ todukok Mesesabel, alokiŋaren Mesesabel todukok Sadok lokoku a Baana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokiŋaren a Sadok todukok Tekoites, nai nyetapa ŋikapolokinitok kec etic ŋolo ke Ekapolon kec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todukokis nabo Pasea ka Mesulam lokoku a Besodeia epuke ŋolo Ŋorot, kiwuakis ŋakito ŋuna a epuke, ŋikekya ka ŋigolyet ta ŋasuwa ŋuna ilorere epuke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todukokis alokiŋaren kec Melatia ŋolo alo Gibeon ka Yadon ŋolo alo Meron, arae ikes ŋikilyok ŋulu alo Gibeon ka Misipa, ŋulu epukat ekepukan ŋolo ka akwap a ŋina Alokekwaye Aŋolol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokiŋaren kec todukok Usiel lokoku ka Araia ŋolo arae epei a ŋiketyakak egolid. Alokiŋaren keŋ todukok Anania ŋolo arae epei a ŋulu enyalak ŋamyeta ŋuna akukunyok, todukokis ikes nabo arwatata Yerusalem todol tari Narwatata ŋina Aburon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokiŋaren kec todukok Rapaia lokoku a Ur ŋolo arae ekepukan ka atutubet a apei a ŋina ka akibois a Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokiŋaren kec todukok Yedaia lokoku ka Arumap neni eteosi ka akai keŋ, ido alokiŋaren todukok Atus lokoku ka Asabineia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todukokis Malakia lokoku ka Arim ka Asub lokoku a Paas-Moab atutubet ace ŋina ka arwatata ta aduketait ŋina aoyan ŋina a Ŋikenoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokiŋaren kec todukok Salum lokoku ka Aloes, ŋolo arae ekepukan a atutubet ka apei a akibois a ŋina a Yerusalem, adukete iŋes kaapei ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulupesur.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Anun ka ŋituŋa ŋulu eboiyete alo Sanoa todukokis nabo epuke ŋolo a Akadipaalat; kiwuakis ŋikekya, ŋigolyet ka ŋasuwa ŋuna ilorere epuke, todukokis daŋ arwatata ŋina arae aoyau keŋ ŋimitae ŋamiae ŋaomwon ka ŋatomoniomwon, todol lopuke ŋolo ka Aoret.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todukok nabo Maliciya lokoku a Rekab, ŋolo arae ekepukan a atutubet a apei a ŋina ka akibois a ŋina a Bes-Akerem epuke ŋolo ka Aoret, kiwuak ŋikekya, ŋigolyet ka ŋasuwa ŋuna ilorere epuke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todukok Salum lokoku a Kolose, ŋolo arae ekepukan a akibois a Misipa, epuke ŋolo a Elelya, todukok arwatata kidiama epuke, kiwuak daŋ ŋikekya, ŋigolyet ka ŋasuwa ŋuna ilorere epuke, tosodi todukok arwatata ŋina ka akare a ŋina a Sela, a akare a emanikor a ŋolo ke erwosit akitodol nadoketa ŋuna etiyaere, kori edokanarere lotaun a Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku keŋ todukok Neemia lokoku ka Asibuk, ŋolo arae ekepukan a atutubet a apei a akibois a ŋina anyaritae Besur ameun aneni eteosi ka alyal a Daudi akitodol neni ayai akare ka lolain a ŋasigarya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku a Neemia, todukokis ŋilepi lu arwatata alokiŋaren keŋ: Todukok Reum lokoku a Bani, totupak Asabia ekepukan a atutubet a apei a akibois a ŋina anyaritae Keila, todukok iŋes arwatata aŋuna a ŋituŋa a akibois keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku ka Asabia todukokis ŋiyeneta keŋ lu arwatata: Todukok Binui lokoku ka Enadad a ekepukan a atutubet a apei a ŋina ka akibois a ŋina anyaritae Keila, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "totupak Eser lokoku a Yesua a ŋolo arae ekepukan a Misipa, abu iŋes todukok arwatata neni eteosi ka neni eŋadatae ŋiboro ŋulujiet alokoona a arwatata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku keŋ todukok Baruk lokoku a Sabai iwace a arwatata ameun alokoona tari lopuke ŋolo a akai ka Eliasib a esacaradoti a ŋolo Apolon nooi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku a Baruk, todukok Meremos lokoku a Uria a ŋolo arae lokoku ka Akos iwace a arwatata ameun alopuke a akai ke Eliasib tari neni isalitor akai ke Eliasib. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku a Meremos todukokis ŋisacaradotin ŋulu eboiyete anakiboisyo a ŋuna edunyito nen arwatata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku a ŋisacaradotin totupakis Benjamin ka Asub, todukokis ŋul arwatata neni iteosi ka akai kec. Ekaku kec todukok Asaria lokoku ka Maaseia a ŋolo arae lokoku ka Anania arwatata neni ebakasi ka akai keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku ka Asaria todukok Binui lokoku a Enadad iwace a arwatata ameun alokai ka Asaria tari lokoona a arwatata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todukok Palal lokoku a Usai arwatata neni eteosi ke ekoona ka aduketait ŋina aoyan ŋina eleŋoro alokai ke erwosit a ŋina alokidiama a ŋina ayai diyete alapatu ŋina a ŋasigarya a ŋuna iyokiyete akai ke erwosit. Ekaku keŋ kiwuapakis Pedaia lokoku a Paros ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka ŋiketiyak ŋulu ka Akai ka Akuj ŋulu eboiyete alo Opel, todukokis ikes arwatata akitodol neni eteosi alo Kide ka epuke ŋolo a Ŋakipi ka aduketait ŋina aoyan ŋina eleŋit ŋakais ŋunace. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku keŋ todukokis Ŋitekoitei iwace a arwatata neni eteosi ka aduketait ŋina aoyan, akitodol narwatata ŋina ka Opel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
