          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todukokis ŋisacaradotin kidiama epuke ŋolo ka Aŋole, todukok ŋinituŋanan neni eteosi ka akai keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku a ŋisacaradotin, todukok Sadok lokoku ka Imer neni eteosi ka akai keŋ. Ekaku keŋ todukok Semaia lokoku a Sekania a eketen a epuke ŋolo alo Kide, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekaku keŋ todukokis Anania lokoku a Selemia ka Anun lokoku a Salap a ŋolo a ŋikanikapei iwace a arwatata. Ekaku ka Anun todukok Mesulam lokoku a Berekia neni amunaara anarwatata neni eteosi ka ŋakais ŋuna eboiyo iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku keŋ kiwuapak Maliciya epei a ŋiketyakak egolid, todukok arwatata akitodol kai ŋina a ŋiketiyak a ŋulu ka Akai ka Akuj ka Kai ŋina a ŋikagyelanarak, neni eteosi ke epuke ŋolo a Mipikad ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:31",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mipikad",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "iŋes epuke ŋolo isyemeere ŋiboro ka ŋituŋa",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " tari nagule ŋina alokidiama ŋina ayai lokoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todukokis ŋikagyelanarak ka ŋiketyakak egolid arwatata ŋina alokidiŋ agule ŋina alokidiama ŋina alokoona ka epuke ŋolo a Ŋamesekin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.32"
            ]
          }
